{
  "name": "dartboard",
  "displayName": "Dartboard: Flutter Test Coverage",
  "description": "Flutter and Dart testing in one panel: line and branch coverage, which widgets and screens your tests render, Bloc/Cubit/Riverpod/Provider state coverage, readable test failures, screen size and accessibility checks, and a PDF audit report.",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "publisher": "sanket-manohar",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/sanket-manohar/dartboard.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/sanket-manohar/dartboard#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/sanket-manohar/dartboard/issues"
  },
  "icon": "media/icon.png",
  "engines": {
    "vscode": "^1.85.0"
  },
  "categories": [
    "Testing",
    "Visualization",
    "Other"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dartboard",
    "flutter",
    "dart",
    "coverage",
    "test coverage",
    "widget test",
    "branch coverage",
    "bloc",
    "riverpod",
    "accessibility"
  ],
  "main": "./out/extension.js",
  "activationEvents": [
    "workspaceContains:**/pubspec.yaml",
    "workspaceContains:**/coverage/lcov.info"
  ],
  "contributes": {
    "viewsContainers": {
      "activitybar": [
        {
          "id": "dartboard",
          "title": "Dartboard",
          "icon": "media/activity-icon.svg"
        }
      ]
    },
    "views": {
      "dartboard": [
        {
          "id": "dartboard.files",
          "name": "Coverage",
          "icon": "media/activity-icon.svg",
          "type": "webview"
        }
      ]
    },
    "commands": [
      {
        "command": "dartboard.run",
        "title": "Run Tests with Coverage",
        "category": "Dartboard",
        "icon": "$(play)"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.refresh",
        "title": "Reload Coverage Report",
        "category": "Dartboard",
        "icon": "$(refresh)"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.viewOptions",
        "title": "Panel Options (Group, Sort, Filters, Goal)",
        "category": "Dartboard",
        "icon": "$(filter)"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.openInsights",
        "title": "Open Insights (Coverage Map, History, Risk)",
        "category": "Dartboard",
        "icon": "$(graph)"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.openHistory",
        "title": "Show Coverage History",
        "category": "Dartboard"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.openRisk",
        "title": "Show Risk Radar",
        "category": "Dartboard"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.openWalkthrough",
        "title": "Take the Tour",
        "category": "Dartboard",
        "icon": "$(question)"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.runTestsFor",
        "title": "Run Tests for This with Coverage",
        "category": "Dartboard",
        "icon": "$(play)"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.createTest",
        "title": "Create Test File",
        "category": "Dartboard",
        "icon": "$(new-file)"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.checkStrength",
        "title": "Check Test Strength",
        "category": "Dartboard",
        "icon": "$(shield)"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.mapTests",
        "title": "Map Tests to Lines (Which Test Covers This?)",
        "category": "Dartboard"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.showTestsForLine",
        "title": "Show Tests Covering This Line",
        "category": "Dartboard"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.share",
        "title": "Share Coverage (PR Summary / README Badge)",
        "category": "Dartboard",
        "icon": "$(share)"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.toggleLive",
        "title": "Toggle Live Coverage on Save",
        "category": "Dartboard",
        "icon": "$(zap)"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.toggleHighlights",
        "title": "Toggle Line Highlights",
        "category": "Dartboard",
        "icon": "$(eye)"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.toggleViewMode",
        "title": "Switch Grouping (Folders / Flat / Layers)",
        "category": "Dartboard",
        "icon": "$(list-tree)"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.changeSort",
        "title": "Change Sort Order",
        "category": "Dartboard",
        "icon": "$(sort-precedence)"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.nextUncovered",
        "title": "Go to Next Uncovered Line",
        "category": "Dartboard",
        "icon": "$(arrow-down)"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.revealActive",
        "title": "Reveal Current File in Coverage Panel",
        "category": "Dartboard"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.clear",
        "title": "Clear Coverage Display",
        "category": "Dartboard",
        "icon": "$(clear-all)"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.resetHistory",
        "title": "Reset Coverage History",
        "category": "Dartboard"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.openFile",
        "title": "Open File",
        "category": "Dartboard"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.openAt",
        "title": "Open At",
        "category": "Dartboard"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.openTest",
        "title": "Open Test",
        "category": "Dartboard"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.runSingleTest",
        "title": "Run Test",
        "category": "Dartboard"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.runAffected",
        "title": "Run Affected Tests (Changed Code Only)",
        "category": "Dartboard",
        "icon": "$(zap)"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.auditReport",
        "title": "Create Audit Report (PDF)",
        "category": "Dartboard",
        "icon": "$(file-pdf)"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.runIntegrationTests",
        "title": "Run Integration Tests on a Device",
        "category": "Dartboard",
        "icon": "$(device-mobile)"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.screenMatrix",
        "title": "Run Widget Test on Screen Sizes and Themes",
        "category": "Dartboard",
        "icon": "$(device-mobile)"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.checkAccessibility",
        "title": "Check Accessibility in This Widget Test",
        "category": "Dartboard",
        "icon": "$(eye)"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.filmstrip",
        "title": "Record Filmstrip of Widget Test",
        "category": "Dartboard",
        "icon": "$(device-camera-video)"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.testChecklist",
        "title": "List Test Cases for This Function",
        "category": "Dartboard",
        "icon": "$(checklist)"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.showWidgetTree",
        "title": "Show Widget Tree Coverage",
        "category": "Dartboard"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.showTab",
        "title": "Show Panel Tab",
        "category": "Dartboard"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.createWidgetTest",
        "title": "Create Widget Test",
        "category": "Dartboard"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.rerunTest",
        "title": "Run Test Again",
        "category": "Dartboard"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.showFailureOutput",
        "title": "Show Full Test Output",
        "category": "Dartboard"
      },
      {
        "command": "dartboard.collapseAll",
        "title": "Collapse All",
        "category": "Dartboard",
        "icon": "$(collapse-all)"
      }
    ],
    "menus": {
      "view/title": [
        {
          "command": "dartboard.run",
          "when": "view == dartboard.files",
          "group": "navigation@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.runAffected",
          "when": "view == dartboard.files && dartboard.hasCoverage",
          "group": "navigation@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.auditReport",
          "when": "view == dartboard.files && dartboard.hasCoverage",
          "group": "navigation@3"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.viewOptions",
          "when": "view == dartboard.files",
          "group": "navigation@4"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.runIntegrationTests",
          "when": "view == dartboard.files && dartboard.hasIntegrationTests",
          "group": "1_run@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.mapTests",
          "when": "view == dartboard.files && dartboard.hasCoverage",
          "group": "1_run@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.toggleLive",
          "when": "view == dartboard.files",
          "group": "1_run@3"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.openInsights",
          "when": "view == dartboard.files && dartboard.hasCoverage",
          "group": "2_view@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.share",
          "when": "view == dartboard.files && dartboard.hasCoverage",
          "group": "2_view@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.openWalkthrough",
          "when": "view == dartboard.files",
          "group": "2_view@3"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.refresh",
          "when": "view == dartboard.files",
          "group": "3_reset@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.clear",
          "when": "view == dartboard.files",
          "group": "3_reset@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.resetHistory",
          "when": "view == dartboard.files",
          "group": "3_reset@3"
        }
      ],
      "editor/title": [
        {
          "command": "dartboard.nextUncovered",
          "when": "resourceLangId == dart && dartboard.hasCoverage",
          "group": "navigation"
        }
      ],
      "editor/context": [
        {
          "command": "dartboard.runTestsFor",
          "when": "resourceLangId == dart",
          "group": "dartboard@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.showTestsForLine",
          "when": "resourceLangId == dart && dartboard.hasCoverage",
          "group": "dartboard@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.checkStrength",
          "when": "resourceLangId == dart && dartboard.hasCoverage",
          "group": "dartboard@3"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.createTest",
          "when": "resourceLangId == dart",
          "group": "dartboard@4"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.testChecklist",
          "when": "resourceLangId == dart && resourcePath =~ /[\\\\/]lib[\\\\/]/",
          "group": "dartboard@5"
        }
      ],
      "explorer/context": [
        {
          "command": "dartboard.runTestsFor",
          "when": "resourceLangId == dart || explorerResourceIsFolder",
          "group": "7_dartboard@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.createTest",
          "when": "resourceLangId == dart",
          "group": "7_dartboard@2"
        }
      ],
      "commandPalette": [
        {
          "command": "dartboard.openFile",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.openAt",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.openTest",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.runSingleTest",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.showWidgetTree",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.showTab",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.createWidgetTest",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.rerunTest",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.showFailureOutput",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.filmstrip",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.screenMatrix",
          "when": "resourceFilename =~ /_test\\.dart$/"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.checkAccessibility",
          "when": "resourceFilename =~ /_test\\.dart$/"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.testChecklist",
          "when": "resourceLangId == dart"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.runIntegrationTests",
          "when": "dartboard.hasIntegrationTests"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.collapseAll",
          "when": "false"
        }
      ],
      "webview/context": [
        {
          "command": "dartboard.runTestsFor",
          "when": "webviewId == 'dartboard.files' && webviewSection =~ /^(file|folder)$/",
          "group": "1_run@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.createTest",
          "when": "webviewId == 'dartboard.files' && webviewSection =~ /^(file|untested)$/",
          "group": "1_run@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "dartboard.checkStrength",
          "when": "webviewId == 'dartboard.files' && webviewSection == file",
          "group": "1_run@3"
        }
      ]
    },
    "configuration": {
      "title": "Dartboard",
      "properties": {
        "dartboard.lcovGlob": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "**/coverage/lcov.info",
          "description": "Glob (relative to each workspace folder) used to find lcov reports. Multiple reports (e.g. in a monorepo) are merged."
        },
        "dartboard.testCommand": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "flutter test --coverage",
          "description": "Command run by 'Run Tests with Coverage'. Use 'dart test --coverage=coverage && dart pub global run coverage:format_coverage ...' for pure Dart packages."
        },
        "dartboard.exclude": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "default": [
            "**/*.g.dart",
            "**/*.freezed.dart",
            "**/*.mocks.dart",
            "**/*.gr.dart",
            "**/*.config.dart",
            "**/generated/**",
            "**/l10n/**"
          ],
          "description": "Glob patterns of files to leave out of the panel, totals and highlights."
        },
        "dartboard.lowThreshold": {
          "type": "number",
          "default": 50,
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 100,
          "description": "Coverage below this percentage is shown in red."
        },
        "dartboard.highThreshold": {
          "type": "number",
          "default": 80,
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 100,
          "description": "Coverage at or above this percentage is shown in green (in between is amber)."
        },
        "dartboard.highlightMode": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "gutter",
            "line",
            "both"
          ],
          "default": "both",
          "enumDescriptions": [
            "Gutter markers only",
            "Line background only",
            "Gutter markers and line background"
          ],
          "description": "How covered/uncovered lines are marked in the editor."
        },
        "dartboard.showCoveredLines": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "description": "Highlight covered lines too (uncovered lines are always highlighted when highlights are on)."
        },
        "dartboard.highlightOnStartup": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "description": "Show line highlights automatically when coverage is loaded."
        },
        "dartboard.viewMode": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "tree",
            "flat",
            "layers"
          ],
          "default": "tree",
          "enumDescriptions": [
            "Grouped by folder, with folder totals",
            "One flat list",
            "Grouped by app layer (UI, State, Data, Utils), guessed from names"
          ],
          "description": "How the coverage panel groups files."
        },
        "dartboard.sortBy": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "name",
            "coverageAsc",
            "coverageDesc"
          ],
          "default": "coverageAsc",
          "enumDescriptions": [
            "Alphabetical",
            "Least covered first",
            "Most covered first"
          ],
          "description": "Sort order of the coverage panel."
        },
        "dartboard.goal": {
          "type": "number",
          "default": 80,
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 100,
          "description": "Your coverage goal in percent, shown as a progress bar in the panel. 0 hides it."
        },
        "dartboard.showUntestedFiles": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "description": "List lib/ files that no test imports (flutter test --coverage leaves them out of lcov.info) at 0%."
        },
        "dartboard.includeUntestedInTotal": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "description": "Count untested files in totals, using an estimate of their executable lines. Gives a more honest total."
        },
        "dartboard.changedFilesOnly": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": false,
          "description": "Only list files changed on the current git branch (vs main/master), including uncommitted changes. Ignored when git is not available."
        },
        "dartboard.liveCoverage": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": false,
          "description": "When you save a Dart file, re-run its related test with coverage in the background and update the highlights."
        },
        "dartboard.flutterCommand": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "flutter",
          "description": "The flutter executable used for background runs (single files, live coverage, test strength, test mapping). Use a full path or 'fvm flutter' style wrapper script if flutter is not on PATH."
        },
        "dartboard.maxMutations": {
          "type": "number",
          "default": 15,
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 100,
          "description": "How many small code changes 'Check Test Strength' tries per file. Each one runs the file's tests once."
        },
        "dartboard.branchCoverage": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "description": "Collect branch coverage (flutter test --branch-coverage) so lines where only one side of an if/else, switch or ?? ran are marked as partly tested."
        },
        "dartboard.includeIntegrationCoverage": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "description": "Merge coverage/integration_lcov.info (written by \"Run Integration Tests on a Device\") into the totals."
        },
        "dartboard.codeLens": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "all",
            "uncovered",
            "off"
          ],
          "enumDescriptions": [
            "Show coverage, widget tree and test tools above functions, build() methods and widget tests.",
            "Only show lenses for code that is not fully tested.",
            "Hide all Dartboard lenses."
          ],
          "default": "all",
          "description": "Which Dartboard hints to show above code."
        },
        "dartboard.testPitfalls": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "description": "Warn about common widget test mistakes (missing pump, missing await, no expect, real delays, missing MaterialApp) with one-click fixes."
        },
        "dartboard.screenMatrix": {
          "type": "array",
          "description": "Screen sizes and themes used by \"Run Widget Test on Screen Sizes and Themes\". Sizes are logical pixels.",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "name",
              "width",
              "height"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "name": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "width": {
                "type": "number"
              },
              "height": {
                "type": "number"
              },
              "pixelRatio": {
                "type": "number",
                "default": 3
              },
              "textScale": {
                "type": "number",
                "default": 1
              },
              "dark": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "default": false
              }
            }
          },
          "default": [
            {
              "name": "Small phone",
              "width": 320,
              "height": 568,
              "pixelRatio": 2
            },
            {
              "name": "Phone",
              "width": 393,
              "height": 852,
              "pixelRatio": 3
            },
            {
              "name": "Tablet",
              "width": 1024,
              "height": 1366,
              "pixelRatio": 2
            },
            {
              "name": "Large text",
              "width": 393,
              "height": 852,
              "pixelRatio": 3,
              "textScale": 2
            },
            {
              "name": "Dark",
              "width": 393,
              "height": 852,
              "pixelRatio": 3,
              "dark": true
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "colors": [
      {
        "id": "dartboard.coveredLineBackground",
        "description": "Background of lines hit by tests.",
        "defaults": {
          "dark": "#2ea04326",
          "light": "#2ea04320",
          "highContrast": "#2ea04340",
          "highContrastLight": "#2ea04340"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "dartboard.uncoveredLineBackground",
        "description": "Background of lines not hit by tests.",
        "defaults": {
          "dark": "#f8514926",
          "light": "#f8514920",
          "highContrast": "#f8514940",
          "highContrastLight": "#f8514940"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "dartboard.weakLineBackground",
        "description": "Background of lines that are covered but where a code change went unnoticed by tests.",
        "defaults": {
          "dark": "#d2992233",
          "light": "#d2992226",
          "highContrast": "#d2992255",
          "highContrastLight": "#d2992255"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "dartboard.partialLineBackground",
        "description": "Background of lines where only some branches ran (for example the if ran but the else never did).",
        "defaults": {
          "dark": "#d2992226",
          "light": "#d299221f",
          "highContrast": "#d2992244",
          "highContrastLight": "#d2992244"
        }
      }
    ],
    "walkthroughs": [
      {
        "id": "gettingStarted",
        "title": "Get started with Dartboard",
        "description": "See what your tests really cover, down to widgets, screens and states, and fix gaps fast.",
        "steps": [
          {
            "id": "run",
            "title": "Run your tests with coverage",
            "description": "Runs `flutter test --coverage` and fills the panel. You can also run tests you already have from a terminal; the panel refreshes on its own.\n[Run Tests with Coverage](command:dartboard.run)",
            "media": {
              "markdown": "media/walkthrough/run.md"
            },
            "completionEvents": [
              "onCommand:dartboard.run"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "panel",
            "title": "Read the panel",
            "description": "The ring shows your coverage and goal, with the last test run under it. Four tabs: **Files**, **Widgets** (what your tests rendered), **States** (Bloc, Cubit, Riverpod, Provider) and **Tests** (failures explained, slow tests, pyramid).\n[Open the panel](command:dartboard.files.focus)",
            "media": {
              "markdown": "media/walkthrough/panel.md"
            },
            "completionEvents": [
              "onView:dartboard.files"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "untested",
            "title": "Close the gaps",
            "description": "Files no test imports are listed under **Not tested yet**. Right-click one and choose **Create Test File** to get a ready-made test with a stub for every public class and method.\n[Show the panel](command:dartboard.files.focus)",
            "media": {
              "markdown": "media/walkthrough/untested.md"
            },
            "completionEvents": [
              "onCommand:dartboard.createTest"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "run-one",
            "title": "Run just one file's tests",
            "description": "Click ▶ next to any file or folder to run only its tests. Turn on **Live coverage** and saving a file does it automatically.\n[Toggle live coverage](command:dartboard.toggleLive)",
            "media": {
              "markdown": "media/walkthrough/runone.md"
            },
            "completionEvents": [
              "onCommand:dartboard.runTestsFor",
              "onCommand:dartboard.toggleLive"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "screens",
            "title": "Test your screens",
            "description": "Above each widget test: run it on several screen sizes and themes, check accessibility, or record a filmstrip. Above each function: the test cases you're still missing.\n[Open the panel](command:dartboard.files.focus)",
            "media": {
              "markdown": "media/walkthrough/screens.md"
            },
            "completionEvents": [
              "onCommand:dartboard.screenMatrix",
              "onCommand:dartboard.checkAccessibility",
              "onCommand:dartboard.filmstrip",
